# Allow-list: nothing is sent to the Docker build unless it is listed here, so
# .env, keys, state files, docs and tests can never end up in the image.
*

!requirements.txt
!app/
!alembic/
!alembic.ini

# Even inside allowed folders, never include these (patterns apply at any depth).
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*known_hosts.json
**/*_message_cursor.json
